# Quarantined dependency trees from a failed install. ESLint skips
# node_modules/ by default but not these, and it followed one into a
# @babel/preset-modules package.json that extends a config which is not
# installed — which aborted the whole lint run rather than reporting on our
# own source. Already gitignored; this keeps the linter out too.
node_modules.corrupt*/
